

>> Cat := Ikintu gishya.

Cat bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: {
	icyacyo sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat bigeze: ['nieuw'] kora: {
	icyacyo sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat bigeze: ['makeSound'] kora: { <- icyacyo sound.
}.

Cat bigeze: ['greet'] kora: { <- ubwacyo makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat gishya.
Ibisohoka andika: cat greet.
